        "en": "The project `acme-data-prod` contains the bucket `gs://acme-reports`. An audit reports:\n\n- the bucket is readable by `allUsers`;\n- it still uses per-object ACLs;\n- the firewall rule `default-allow-ssh` is open to `0.0.0.0/0`.\n\nWith `gcloud`:\n\n1. remove public access from the bucket;\n2. enable uniform access and public access prevention;\n3. delete the open SSH rule and create a rule allowing SSH from IAP only;\n4. connect to the VM `reports-1` (zone `europe-west1-b`) through IAP.\n"
